<title>NORWAY: SOCCER-NORWAY AND FINLAND DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NORWAY AND FINLAND DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway and Finland drew 1-1</p>
<p>halftime 0-0) in a World Cup soccer European group three</p>
<p>qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Norway - Ole Gunnar Solskjaer 83</p>
<p>Finland - Antti Sumiala 60</p>
<p>Attendance: 22,287</p>
<p>Norway: 1-Frode Grodaas, 2-Dan Eggen, 4-Henning Berg,</p>
<p>3-Ronny Johnsen (13-Gunnar Halle 28th), 5-Stig Inge Bjoernebye,</p>
<p>9-Ole Gunnar Solskjaer, 7-Erik Mykland, 10-Kjetil Rekdal,</p>
<p>8-Staale Solbakken, 6-Frank Strandli (16-Jostein Flo 62nd),</p>
<p>11-Tore Andre Flo.</p>
<p>Finland: 1-Antti Niemi, 2-Marko Tuomela, 3-Sami Hyypia</p>
<p>(16-Mika Lehkusou 4th). 4-Jussi Nuorela, 5-Jukka Koskinen,</p>
<p>6-Sami Mahlio, 7-Kari Rissanen, 8-Mika Nurmela (13-Janne</p>
<p>Maekelae 86th), 9-Antti Sumiala, 10-Jari Litmanen, 11-Jonatan</p>
<p>Johansson (14-Joonas Kolkka 82nd).</p>
</text>
